  "translation": "Gomme Pekaha, mora wa Remalijahu, mošomi wa boraro wa yena, a dira kgwerano kgahlanong le yena, gomme a mo otla ka Shomeroni, kagong e phagamego ya ntlo ya kgoši, le ⟨את⟩ Argobe le ⟨את⟩ Arie, gomme le yena masomehlano a banna, ba ba tšwago go bara ba Gileada; gomme a bolaya yena, gomme a busa legato la yena.",
